{
  "style": "Premium cozy minimalism with tactile materials: a sunlit, top‑left key light (35°) kisses soft‑touch paper tiles resting in a shallow wooden tray; edges are rounded and chamfered with a 1–2 px highlight and tight ambient occlusion in seams to suggest hand‑cut card stock. Surfaces carry a whisper of paper grain and 1% film grain; shading is calm and even, with gentle falloff shadows that lift elements from a warm parchment backdrop. Numbers are subtly embossed ink, flags are stitched fabric with a faint sheen and tiny fiber texture, mines are abstract seed pods in matte ceramic with a satin rim light—nothing violent. The overall mood is restful, offline, and thoughtfully crafted; color is warm and low‑saturation with clear contrast, depth is layered in three tiers (background, tray, interactive pieces) for instant legibility, and micro‑animations feel springy and humane.",
